Schwartie's Hash Browns. (Mary Ann)
2 lbs. frozen hash browns      }
1 - 500 ml. sour cream         }
2 tins mushroom soup           }
1/2 c melted butter            }
grated onion & salt to taste   }
2 c grated cheddar cheese.     }
Parmesan cheese.
thaw potatoes slightly for easier mixing. Mix 1st 6
ingred. in a 9 x 13" pan. Sprinkle c̄ Parmesan on top.
                        Bake @ 350° for 1 - 1 1/2 hrs.
